        "raw": "<p>The Kickstarter rules say that some of the Tech cards you install will have their own Weaponry and Defense values, and that you should keep their tokens separate from your main ship tokens. It mentions that these cards might &quot;grant&quot; their W and D values to the main ship, which I&#39;m assuming means that you add the Tech token to the ship tokens when determining overall W and D values (yes? &nbsp;Maybe that&#39;s spelled out on the cards themselves?). The rules further state that if the tokens are ever removed from Tech, the Tech is destroyed. But I don&#39;t actually see any rules about how Tech would ever go about losing their tokens.&nbsp;</p><p>When you take damage, can you choose to remove tokens from your Tech instead of your main ship? &nbsp;If so, are there any rules about whether to remove tokens from Tech or the ship first? &nbsp;If this stuff is mentioned in the rules, I may have missed it.&nbsp;</p>",
