        "created_at": "2013-04-18T17:24:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Think of it this way: all of the Weaponry and Defenses of a ship make up its Energy. You can think of the Energy as the HP. However, besides just being HP, the Energy that is Weaponry is also your attack, and the Energy that is Defense is also damage mitigation.</p>",
